msgid "数据处理"
msgstr "Data processing"

#: ../../source/api/reference/data.md:3 cfc5e0d445054d2ab23991c2fc2e35aa
msgid ""
"模型级数据基类与数据源基类。各数据集处理器（`utils/data_process/<dataset>.py`）均继承 "
"`DataSource`，按需实现 `load_src_data` / `clean_raw_data` / `transform_data`。"
msgstr ""
"Model-level data base classes and data source base class. Each dataset "
"handler (`utils/data_process/<dataset>.py`) inherits `DataSource` and "
"implements `load_src_data` / `clean_raw_data` / `transform_data` as "
"needed."

